# `totimespan` reads `[-][d.]hh:mm[:ss[.f]]` and short forms such as `90m`.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = totimespan('1.02:03:04'), b = totimespan('90m'), c = totimespan('-00:00:01.5'), d = totimespan('soon'), e = totimespan(1h), f = totimespan(60)
---- expected
a          | b        | c           | d        | e        | f
timespan   | timespan | timespan    | timespan | timespan | timespan
-----------+----------+-------------+----------+----------+---------
1.02:03:04 | 01:30:00 | -00:00:01.5 | null     | 01:00:00 | null
